mindmap
  root((snowgate))
    You do once
      npm install -g snowgate
      snowgate setup
        Pick the agent
        Approve instances
        Save credentials
      Approve risky steps
        Upload / commit
        Other instances
    The agent does
      Opens a YallaFlow task
      Binds the instance
      Reads the instance
        sn_query
        sn_get_record
        snowgate discover
      Changes through the browser
        ui_use_update_set first
        ui_type / ui_select / ui_click
      Verifies
        snowgate check
    Always guarded
      One instance per task
      Own update set, never Default
      Read only REST
      Secrets never read
      Every call audited
    Learns from you
      snowgate feedback list
      snowgate feedback send
